; GoldDualBasketDCA v53 recommended — Scalping Ai Pro By Farhan FX
; Load in MetaTrader 5 Strategy Tester: Inputs -> Load.
; Symbol XAUUSD, period M1, hedging account.
; Suggested deposit $30,000 (the deposit used for this project's 3-month reference).
; Use "Every tick based on real ticks" when that history exists.
; Dates to run, separately and as one continuous test:
;   2026.06.01-2026.06.30, 2026.07.01-2026.07.31, 2026.08.01-2026.08.31,
;   2026.08.24-2026.08.27 (known stress window), and 2026.06.01-2026.08.31.
; Set the tester leverage to the live account's leverage.
; If the tester symbol charges no commission, set InpCommissionPerLotPerSide
; to the live per-lot-per-side cost (account currency). 0 reads the open deal.
; There is no stop-loss in this preset.
; InpUseMarginGuard is off. An approximate M1 replay of August 2026 showed
; a 200% add-pause freezing the losing basket. Turn it on only as a
; separate tester pass, on the live account's leverage.
; InpUseTrendAwareSpacing and InpPauseAddsWhenExtreme are off. On the
; June 2026 drop both made the drawdown deeper. They are inputs so a
; tester pass can turn them on deliberately.

